
Bank Credit & Debit Analysis — Excel
Overview
This module contains the Microsoft Excel analysis for the Bank Credit & Debit Analysis project.

Excel is used for data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, KPI calculations, Pivot Tables, Pivot Charts, and initial business insights.

Objectives
Clean and validate banking transaction data.
Analyze credit and debit transactions.
Calculate important banking KPIs.
Analyze monthly transaction trends.
Identify high-value customers.
Analyze transaction categories.
Prepare data for SQL, Power BI, and Tableau.
Workbook Structure
Bank_Credit_Debit_Analysis.xlsx
│
├── Raw_Data
├── Cleaned_Data
├── Data_Dictionary
├── KPI_Analysis
├── Customer_Analysis
├── Credit_Analysis
├── Debit_Analysis
├── Monthly_Analysis
└── Dashboard
