Analysis
Credit Analysis
Analyze total credit amount, credit transaction count, monthly credit trends, customer-level credit activity, and credit by category.

Debit Analysis
Analyze total debit amount, debit transaction count, monthly debit trends, customer-level debit activity, and debit by category.

Customer Analysis
Identify:

Top customers
Most active customers
High-value customers
Customers with high credit activity
Customers with high debit activity
